    "created_at": "2016-11-19T18:21:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-19T18:21:56Z",
    "body": "But just like oldValue it would be expensive and not there by default, at which point you might as well use oldValue. Closing this since the current API seems fine for this case.\n",
